WEBVTT

00:15:28.261 --> 00:15:31.553
"Officers Taser 86-year-old
Disabled Woman in her Bed."

00:15:31.577 --> 00:15:33.783
(Laughter)

00:15:33.807 --> 00:15:35.911
I checked the reports on this one.

00:15:35.935 --> 00:15:38.009
I looked at it. I was really surprised.

00:15:38.033 --> 00:15:42.201
Apparently, she took up a more
threatening position in her bed.

00:15:42.225 --> 00:15:43.915
(Laughter)

00:15:43.939 --> 00:15:45.988
I kid you not,
that's exactly what it said:

00:15:46.012 --> 00:15:48.999
"She took up a more threatening
position in her bed."

00:15:49.366 --> 00:15:50.682
OK.

00:15:50.706 --> 00:15:52.151
But I'd remind you --

00:15:52.175 --> 00:15:54.691
I'm talking about military
uses of nonlethal weapons,

00:15:54.715 --> 00:15:55.873
so why is this relevant?

00:15:55.897 --> 00:15:59.119
Because police are actually
more restrained in the use of force

00:15:59.143 --> 00:16:00.610
than the military are.